        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "de Courcy Estate Agents are delighted to offer for sale this first floor 2 bedroomed apartment. Property forms part of a large mixed unit housing Estate known as Bru na Gruadan which comprises of apartments, duplex units, semi-detached and townhouses. It is ideally located off the Groody Roundabout in Castletroy   close to a range of amenities including University of Limerick, supermarkets, cafés, schools, gyms, pharmacies, restaurants, public transport links, and easy access to Limerick City Centre and major motorway routes.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended. \r\n\r\nContact : Richard de Courcy – 087 2535740\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nEntrance hall & Stairs:\r\n\r\nOpen plan living / kitchen / dining room: 5.9m. x 3.6m.\r\nSink unit, worktop, presses, drawers and eyelevel presses.  \r\nGas boiler. Washing machine, oven, dishwasher, fridge and microwave.  \r\n\t\r\nBathroom & toilet:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:    4m. x 2.7m. \r\nShower & toilet ensuite. Double built in wardrobes.\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 2:    3.9m. x 3m.  \r\nDouble built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nHotpress:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHEATING:          Gas heating\r\n\r\nWINDOWS:        PVC double glazed windows\r\n\r\nAGE:                   2002\r\n\r\nBER:                   D1\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA:   64.33 sq. m.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: Currently vacant.  Previously owner occupied.\t\r\n\r\n\r\nINCLUDED: Washing machine, oven, dishwasher, fridge, Microwave and contents.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nVIEWING:  By appointment with Estate Agents\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------\r\nThese particulars are issued by de Courcy Estate Agents on the understanding that any \r\nnegotiations relating to the property are conducted through them. While every care \r\nis taken in preparing them, de Courcy Estate Agents, for themselves and for the \r\nvendor/lessor whose agents they are, give notice that: (1) The particulars are\r\n set out as general outline for guiding potential but must satisfy themselves \r\n(at their own expense) as their correctness. (3) Neither de Courcy Estate Agents\r\n or any of its employees have any authority to make any or give any \r\nrepresentation or warranty in relation to the property."
